{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"agent_message","text":"I found a recovery regression: if Retry is refused at admission or its result is lost, `workbenchCall` returns `undelivered`, but the recovery handler clears the failure. That removes the warning and Retry button without opening a collection. A read-only probe confirmed both cases through the production call adapter and store. The provenance checks passed."}}
